{
  "id": "air___speed_of_sound_vs__temperature",
  "title": "Air - Speed of Sound vs. Temperature",
  "description": "Speed of sound in air at standard atmospheric pressure with temperatures ranging -40 to 1000 °C (-40 to 1500 °F) - Imperial and SI Units.",
  "type": "chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Speed of Sound in Air Calculator\n\nCalculate the speed of sound in air based on temperature using the following formulas:\n\n**SI Units (Metric):**\n- Formula: v = 20.05 × √(273.16 + t)\n- Where: v = velocity of sound (m/s), t = temperature (°C)\n\n**Imperial Units (BG):**\n- Formula: v = 49.03 × √(459.7 + t)\n- Where: v = velocity of sound (ft/s), t = temperature (°F)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "temperature_celsius",
          "label": "Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "°C"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "speed_of_sound_ms",
          "label": "Speed of Sound (SI)",
          "formula": "20.05 * (273.16 + inputs.temperature_celsius) ** 0.5",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "temperature_fahrenheit",
          "label": "Temperature (converted)",
          "formula": "inputs.temperature_celsius * 9/5 + 32",
          "unit": "°F",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "speed_of_sound_fts",
          "label": "Speed of Sound (Imperial)",
          "formula": "49.03 * (459.7 + inputs.temperature_celsius * 9/5 + 32) ** 0.5",
          "unit": "ft/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
